+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/periods/{periodName}/soft-close — soft-close a period (body: {user}),
+# fixing its due-total and each person's due-total in it as they are now, as a close does; claims dated
+# inside it may still be added (marked late entries), edited, opened, settled and voided. It may later be
+# closed (fixing the figures afresh) or reopened. Refused (400) as a close is: when the sheet's permission
+# matrix (perm-close) does not allow the user's role, when the period is not on the sheet or is already
+# closed or soft-closed; nothing is stored then. Recorded in the audit file as PERIOD_SOFT_CLOSED.
